WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.545
Some days, you don't want to show your face. That's okay. You don't have to.

2
00:00:06.845 --> 00:00:12.449
Turn the camera off, and just talk. Your words are still written down, the same as always.

3
00:00:13.749 --> 00:00:19.643
Other days, even opening the app feels like a lot. So keep it one tap away.

4
00:00:20.943 --> 00:00:24.927
Add the Record control to Control Center, and the camera's right there.

5
00:00:26.227 --> 00:00:31.232
Or put today's question on your lock screen. Tap it, and the question is waiting for you.

6
00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:37.874
Saying one hard thing out loud can help. Tell Anew is there when you're ready.
